00:00:41.385 --> 00:00:43.185
a link in the, uh, description box.

00:00:43.725 --> 00:00:48.555
And you have a lot of videos where
you explain how to learn languages,

00:00:48.585 --> 00:00:52.515
but in particular, you focus
on this issue of pronunciation.

00:00:53.475 --> 00:00:58.275
So, uh, it's fine to say that
pronunciation doesn't matter as long

00:00:58.275 --> 00:01:01.575
as you can understand, as long as
